    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>, where geometric shapes have gone rogue, and the emptiness is <i>all-consuming</i>. Traverse this vast void on your quest to collect mosaic pieces in an attempt to... well just to <strong>create</strong>! Because what sense is there in existing, when your only task is to <i>destroy</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third person shooter with roguelike elements, you fight your favourite geometric shapes like <i>Triangles</i>, <i>Parallelograms</i> and even <i>Hexagons</i>, in order to progress and unlock abstract pieces of potentially beautiful art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <u>Dark Mode</u> and <u>Light Mode</u>, to change the dynamic of the run on the fly, because who knows... Maybe a change of scenery has an effect on your fighting ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon with a variety of cubes that will give you the ability to shoot<strong> harder</strong>, jump <strong>higher</strong> and be (a little more) <strong>indestructible</strong>. As your art collection grows, you can also unlock <i>attachments</i> to your mask, each with a <strong>unique functionality</strong> that makes every adventure into the void memorable.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>ABSTRACTICA</strong>, where geometric shapes have gone rogue, and the emptiness is <i>all-consuming</i>. Traverse this vast void on your quest to collect mosaic pieces in an attempt to... well just to <strong>create</strong>! Because what sense is there in existing, when your only task is to <i>destroy</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this third person shooter with roguelike elements, you fight your favourite geometric shapes like <i>Triangles</i>, <i>Parallelograms</i> and even <i>Hexagons</i>, in order to progress and unlock abstract pieces of potentially beautiful art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <u>Dark Mode</u> and <u>Light Mode</u>, to change the dynamic of the run on the fly, because who knows... Maybe a change of scenery has an effect on your fighting ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your weapon with a variety of cubes that will give you the ability to shoot<strong> harder</strong>, jump <strong>higher</strong> and be (a little more) <strong>indestructible</strong>. As your art collection grows, you can also unlock <i>attachments</i> to your mask, each with a <strong>unique functionality</strong> that makes every adventure into the void memorable.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this fast-paced third person shooter with roguelike elements, you traverse a vast void and combat a variety of geometric shapes, to collect artistic mosaics. Because only this can fill the void around and inside of you...",
